{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgorJxxCMRt3qPP42yt43","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**What I told my colleague at lunch:**\n\nThis page is clear about what it can't do. Every single card has a red \"לא מחושב\" tag, and the banner at the top says \"החוקים והכללים לכל המוצרים כאן עוד בבדיקה. עד שייסגרו, האתר לא מחשב אותם.\"\n\nHere's what it can't compute yet:\n- **Tracker-type products:** ETCs, gold through a fund (\"השקעה בזהב דרך קרנות סל\"), currency-hedged funds (\"מנוטרלת מט\"ח\"), dollar deposits and foreign-currency accounts, and the conversion fee (\"עמלת חליפין\").\n- **Bonds and debt:** corporate bonds, Israel bonds (אגרות בונדס), commercial paper (נע\"מ), debt settlements (הסדר חוב).\n- **Structured stuff:** structured products and structured deposits, and the bonus on a deposit (מענק).\n- **Insurance products:** ביטוח מנהלים, participating policies, קרן י', IRA-style tracks (מסלולי האירוע) and insurance-fund plans (קופת ביטוח).\n- **Pension payout:** commuted pension, exempt payments, תיקון 190.\n- **Others:** REITs, digital managed portfolios, investment marketing (שיווק השקעות), and the LAYA dollar wallet.\n\nOn top of that, a closing section, \"מה האתר לא משווה ולא עושה\", says it will never cover picking single stocks, trading, derivatives, mortgages, insurance other than risk policies, physical real estate, or ranking funds by past return.\n\nI'm fairly sure about this. The banner plus \"לא מחושב\" on every card decided it. For my setup, the gaps that matter are the FX conversion fee, currency-hedged funds and dollar money, and anything with single stocks. So today it gives me nothing I can compare with what I pay. And the conversion rate is the one cost I've never actually checked.\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n1. The title and the red banner.\n2. Card titles and the \"לא מחושב\" tags. I scrolled fast through the grid.\n3. I opened the \"מצב הכיסוי\" folds a few times. Almost every blocker is a tax question that's still open (\"שאלה פתוחה\"): how losses on a bond are taxed, tax on foreign-currency deposits, tax on gold funds, and so on. Some items are struck through as closed, with dates.\n4. The final list and the footer: \"אישי, לא מסחרי, בלי קישורי שיווק\". I saw no broker name anywhere, which is good.\n\n**What I skipped:** the \"מה ידוע\" definitions. I didn't need them. I also skipped the law citations and page numbers.\n\n**Where I hesitated:**\n- The screenshots skip between cards, so I didn't see every title. A few were cut off, for example the one about a company that must appoint someone to watch over bondholders, which I guess is a נאמן. So the list above may be incomplete.\n- Codes like \"MF-28\" and \"TXA-28\" mean nothing to me.\n- The gold card and the LAYA card are tagged \"לפי החברה\", meaning the info comes from the issuer itself. It's at least labelled.\n\n**What bugged me:**\n- There isn't a single number on the page. It's a list of what's missing.\n- Every card repeats the same boilerplate, \"כשייסגר: יופיע במדריך...\".\n- I'd have closed the tab after about 20 seconds if I hadn't come here specifically to see the gaps."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7310,"cache_read_input_tokens":15079,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7310},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"37f59b56-99a9-480d-9eb5-f44bca1a4d8f","uuid":"f97f50b2-fa0f-4c3e-ba60-58af010b8a57","timestamp":"2026-11-07T16:04:08.875Z","request_id":"req_011CgorJxjoFUZYyxK2yWy7m"}
